      "created_at": "2025-10-18T08:18:02.612Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, you do it from System Settings.<br>\nGo to System Settings → Change to any language.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/8/f81b878f8d42a9cfdd5e4a58e3450627ffbe762b.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f81b878f8d42a9cfdd5e4a58e3450627ffbe762b\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/8/f81b878f8d42a9cfdd5e4a58e3450627ffbe762b_2_690x221.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zoRosaPNkhUgJ2fOo67PWOiIpCj\" width=\"690\" height=\"221\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/8/f81b878f8d42a9cfdd5e4a58e3450627ffbe762b_2_690x221.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/8/f81b878f8d42a9cfdd5e4a58e3450627ffbe762b_2_1035x331.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/8/f81b878f8d42a9cfdd5e4a58e3450627ffbe762b.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F9F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1272×408 34.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>And you can set Language specific to the users for that go to user and Change to any language.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/6/8686ffe449f4f7214873059ff11e3e582a672184.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/8686ffe449f4f7214873059ff11e3e582a672184\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/6/8686ffe449f4f7214873059ff11e3e582a672184_2_689x310.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"jc5dpspYbSnqQa4lAya0qEGKKgY\" width=\"689\" height=\"310\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/6/8686ffe449f4f7214873059ff11e3e582a672184_2_689x310.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/6/8686ffe449f4f7214873059ff11e3e582a672184_2_1033x465.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/6/8686ffe449f4f7214873059ff11e3e582a672184.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9FAF9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1231×554 46 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
