      "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:57:34.470Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"rk_root\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"155717\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/rk_root/48/66073_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> rk_root:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>System Settings</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Some languages ​​can be enabled without any problems, and the interface language can be changed, but others, such as Russian or Ukrainian, don’t work. Could you tell me what the problem might be? Perhaps I need to download additional files?</p>",
